# Converted from corpus/flowcharts/0139.mmd by corpus/convert.py.
Request from a grantee -> "Owner-only?"
"Owner-only?" -> "Refused: only the owner": yes
"Owner-only?" -> Size and hourly limit: no
Size and hourly limit -> "Refused: try later": over
Size and hourly limit -> Classifier: ok
Classifier -> Runs like the owner's: allow
Classifier -> Refused: deny or error
